+**Pseudocode:**
+```python
+def trace_path(q, omega, iaddf, max_depth=0):
+    # Query DDF for distance and visibility in the ray direction
+    dist = iaddf.d(q, -omega)
+    vis = iaddf.xi(q, -omega)
+    
+    # Termination: ray misses geometry
+    if vis <= 0.5:
+        return iaddf.EL(-omega)
+    
+    # Compute next intersection point
+    q_next = q + dist * omega
+    
+    # Compute surface normal from DDF gradients [G]
+    n = compute_normal_from_ddf(q_next, omega)
+    
+    # Sample outgoing direction using importance sampler
+    omega_s = iaddf.Psi(q_next, n)
+    
+    # Recursive bounce
+    L_next = trace_path(q_next, omega_s, iaddf, max_depth + 1)
+    
+    # Attenuate by BRDF and add local emission
+    return iaddf.fB(q_next, -omega, omega_s) * L_next + iaddf.ML(q_next, -omega)
+```
 
